Modifications to git v2.56.1 for HTTP(S) on the wasip2 build, on top of
git-wasi.patch (see ../NOTICE.md): live pipes to commands started through
eryx:process/pipe in run-command.c (with wasi-pipes.c's file descriptors),
shell commands without shell syntax run as a plain argv (credential
helpers), start_async run inline with its output spooled, send-pack's
receive-status demuxer started once the request is sent, and remote-curl
built into git as `git remote-http`/`remote-https`, linked with libcurl.

